B.art=new A.oi("Privacy Policy | CommonsLens","Learn how CommonsLens works without analytics or advertising trackers, what stays on your device, which providers receive necessary requests, and what is not collected.","https://commonslens.github.io/privacy/",!0)
B.aru=new A.oi("Wikimedia Commons Map Search | CommonsLens","Discover geotagged Wikimedia Commons media with point, radius, and place searches, clustered previews, metadata filters, and downloadable results.","https://commonslens.github.io/map/",!0)
